{
  "_comment": "Maps each Contentstack SDK repo to its GitHub source, for two uses: (1) source-level signature comparison as a second opinion alongside the installed npm/pip/gem/etc package - useful because the TypeScript Delivery SDK already showed the installed package's compiled output can diverge from its own type declarations, so checking the repo source can confirm whether a mismatch is a source bug or just a broken build/bundle step; (2) running the repo's own example/test files as an additional sanity check. Language/toolchain support has to be added one at a time (npm/tsx already works for TS and JS repos below); other languages need their own runtime set up before any repo here can actually be cloned-and-executed against.",
